  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.18,
      "text": "Plenty of people have that. Energy, ambition, and no idea where to point any of it. And the thing that fixes it almost never arrives as more information."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 8.7,
      "end": 17.94,
      "text": "So the most valuable person in your corner isn't the one standing at the front of the room. It's the one sitting in the seat beside you, telling you what you just got wrong, while you can still do something about it."
    }
  ]
}